ty "Note" "Stocked ATTEND 123A-42B02 Key B 4.2 mm socket. Primary sheet 1 C.H. 2.90 ±0.15 mm is the CARD CENTERLINE above PCB, confirmed by the dashed centerline in sheet 2 mating view. RM520N-GL PCB thickness0.80 ±0.08 mm gives card underside2.50 mm nominal and2.31 mm conservative minimum (2.90−0.15−0.44), excluding any positive socket solder lift. Supersedes connector-proposal01 erroneous underside2.90/min2.75 interpretation. H1 retention-notch center25,18.25 remains geometrically correct; select actual M2 hardware matching2.2 mm carrier hole and nominal2.50 mm support height, not3 mm. Current listed front under-card max1.15 mm +0.10 mm assembly margin clears by1.06 mm; maximum proposed1.50 mm body +0.10 clears by0.71 mm, subject final saved native inventory and module flatness. Actual card XY10..40/18.25..70.25. Five VCC contacts rated1 A each at25°C still air/30°C rise; actual current distribution/hot operation needs first-build verification. Passive cable power nonisolated; no1500 Vrms wholeboard isolation claim. True primary lands/pegs unchanged. RM520 RevA physical pin73 is connected directly to the system ground plane per production Hardware DesignV1.3 Table8/pin assignment; the obsolete R27 zero-ohm link and M2_VIO_CFG legacy alias are retired. Pin24 VDDIO_1V8 output remains NC. No firmware voltage-selector semantics remain for pin73; RM551E secondary compatibility still requires its production guide and assembled validation." (id 5) (at 76.2 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide)) (property "Manufacturer" "ATTEND Technology" (id 6) (at 76.2 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide)) (property "MPN" "123A-42B02" (id 7) (at 76.2 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide)) (pin "1" (uuid 113ff1d3-8d6d-4b0c-9247-31954df512e6)) (pin "3" (uuid 038cd379-fe3e-4363-8c44-45a27ccc8724)) (pin "5" (uuid f411ad48-2f82-437d-9e0a-51d266490a65)) (pin "7" (uuid 80f32076-2ab7-4455-b65f-04f1623331d0)) (pin "9