SB between modem and ownership mux, gated by USB_GATE; channel3 retains hardware RM520 RESET67 sink through S3 GND/D3 RESET and OOB_MODEM_RESET. Channel4 isolates the modem eFuse current monitor from ESP32 GPIO9 when independent AON is not power-good: S4 pin12=MODEM_IMON_TO_ISOLATOR, D4 pin11=OOB_ADC_MODEM_CURRENT, SEL4 pin13=AON_PG; VDD14 remains protected V3V7. Current-native footprint remains F12.6,79.0/90 degrees. R756 is the fitted 1M ILM observer branch; R757 is the fitted MCU-side 100k pull-down. The S4 ordinary tented 0.55/0.20 receiver at12.3,74.3 and D4 literal Type7 0.40/0.15 terminal receiver preserve existing USB/reset copper and the actual source-reference areas. No ADC capacitor is placed directly on raw ILM. Published powered-off VDD0 leakage is not a claim for arbitrary partial VDD. The engineering transfer tolerance, partial-rail states, powered-off injection, 150ms settling, calibration, ramp/fault and firmware commissioning gates remain in the companion power qualification packet." (id 5) (at 129.54 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide)) (property "Manufacturer" "Texas Instruments" (id 6) (at 129.54 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide)) (property "MPN" "TMUX1511PWR" (id 7) (at 129.54 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide)) (pin "1" (uuid 0503e510-5533-48db-b8e6-1f4e083b7dcb)) (pin "2" (uuid 79928ef3-c061-4a90-993a-840942add79b)) (pin "3" (uuid 8db28444-10eb-4fb7-8ba3-756e20bf63de)) (pin "4" (uuid 48990487-af02-4046-9a85-bdaae95f16a3)) (pin "5" (uuid 0da2557d-aab6-4f07-a5b2-96d7551779b3)) (pin "6" (uuid 174d58d9-5cf6-42d8-85e7-d36459618b95)) (pin "8" (uuid d727474d-e671-4d54-ae35-3811aff81555)) (pin "10" (uuid 2e99a42d-421b-4911-a614-fdf09769e8dc)) (pin "11" (uuid 92690697-6420-4fdf-a74e-08ed30e90e2a)) (pin "12" (uuid 9894cb8f-2c08-44b3-b20b-f3ecfc4a30f8)) (pin "13" (uuid 3e0d474d-dde0-4723-ab1f-7ad2d2d3520c)) (pin "14" (uuid 44e4e0a2-8d22-4176-8ca5-40095797239b)) (pin "